<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM nine months net down three percent.</title>
<headline>KLM nine months net down three percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months 96/97 to end-Dec.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				   522     vs  539</p>
<p>    Profit per share (guilders)		5.62  vs    5.81</p>
<p>    Operating profit			   243     vs  553</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)		 6.84  vs    6.38</p>
<p>    Other revenue				979     vs  911</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions)    7.82  vs    7.29</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses (billions)    7.58  vs    6.74</p>
<p>    Financial charges			  143     vs  134</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales		     15     vs   34</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	 379     vs  166</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings		75     vs   58</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			     569     vs  677</p>
<p>    Tax charge				    47     vs  138</p>
<p>    Cash flow from operations		791     vs  957</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
